p=[\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"yes\",\"no\",\"no\"]
with open('answers.jsonl','w') as f:
 for n,(a,b,d) in enumerate(zip(r,c,p),1):
  conf={str(i+1):'high' for i in range(len(b))}
  note=''
  if n==17:
   conf['1']='low'
   note='First final glyph is worn; upper flag survives in fragments.'
  f.write(json.dumps(dict(item_id=a['item_id'],slots={str(i+1):x for i,x in enumerate(b)},confidence=conf,unmarked_final_hard_signs=[],pre1918=d,note=note),ensure_ascii=False)+'\\n')
a=[json.loads(s) for s in open('answers.jsonl')]
assert len(a)==len(r)==95
for source,out in zip(r,a):
 assert source['item_id']==out['item_id']
 keys={str(i) for i in range(1,source['slots']+1)}
 assert set(out['slots'])==keys==set(out['confidence'])
 assert all(v in ['ъ','ь','other','u'] for v in out['slots'].values())
 assert all(v in ['high','low'] for v in out['confidence'].values())
 assert out['pre1918'] in ['yes','no','unclear']
cnt=collections.Counter(v for x in a for v in x['slots'].values())
print('Validated:',len(a),'items; matching order and complete slot coverage')
print('Slot calls:',dict(cnt),'total',sum(cnt.values()))
print('Items with unmarked final hard signs:',sum(bool(x['unmarked_final_hard_signs']) for x in a))
